# ==============================================================================
# Singo Tools .gitignore
# ==============================================================================

# OS & Temporary Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.zip
*.tmp
*.bak

# IDE & Editor Settings
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# Debugging & Runtime Logs
debug.log
singo-debug.log

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub Markdown Policy:
# ONLY README.md and MODULE_RULES.md are published/committed to GitHub.
# Internal AI rules (AGENTS.md, GEMINI.md, PROJECT_RULES.md, Knowledge/, etc.) are kept locally only.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*.md
!/README.md
!/MODULE_RULES.md

# Internal AI Knowledge Base
/Knowledge/
